<title>USA: FARMERS TEAMS WITH CITIBANK FOR CAR LOANS.</title>
<headline>FARMERS TEAMS WITH CITIBANK FOR CAR LOANS.</headline>
<dateline>CHEYENNE, Wyo. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farmers Insurance Group Inc said Wednesday that it and Citibank have joined together to offer auto loans through Farmers' 614 insurance agents.</p>
<p>Farmers said it will also offer credit life and disability coverage, where approved, through its life-insurance company, Farmers New World Life.</p>
<p>The company said the program has been launched in Wyoming, Colorado, Nevada, Oregon, Arizona and California. It will be expanded in phases to the remaining 23 states where Farmers Insurance operates.</p>
<p>Farmers Insurance provides auto, homeowners', commercial and life-insurance.</p>
</text>
